**Workflow (guidance, not a lock):** On the kit path, **prepare each stage artifact** — do not skip documents. “Skip” means skip extra approvals: one “defaults OK” after Grill/Spec recs, then Accept. If spec/plan are missing and they are still on the path, prepare them from those defaults. Off-path only if they explicitly leave the kit — then warn once and follow. Dirty tree, silent stash/reset, and fake verify/accept stay hard.

